      "content": "yeah exactly. it's like i'm stuck in this loop of just pretending to care about things that don't even matter. sometimes i look at my life and i just think... why am i even still fighting to stay in a world that i don't even recognize or belong to anymore? it would be so much quieter if i just didn't have to carry this.",
